25	/**
26	 * The first-insurance surcharge is +10%, applied as the exact ratio 11/10
27	 * rather than a 1.1 multiplier. Floating-point `100 * 1.1` is
28	 * 110.00000000000001, which rounds up to 111 and yields a 116 G premium
29	 * instead of 115 G. Multiplying before dividing keeps the arithmetic exact.
